  "description": "Taeyeon and Sangwoo have been married for two years and recently moved to a suburban area. In this new town, she starts her own business as a hairdresser. Everything seems to be going well, except for the fact that Sangwoo is suffering from erectile dysfunction. He understands Taeyeon’s frustration and so he shows his love in a different way: by giving her some “free time” once a week. As more and more customers start to show a special interest in Taeyeon, it seems like her barbershop is becoming a cheater’s paradise…\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)",
